dent color control allows different day/night appearances or dynamic color shows. Premium choice for flagship locations demanding maximum brand presence.\", \"sku\": \"BL-CHL-DL01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/dual-lit-channel-letters-pro\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_dual-lit-channel-letters-pro.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/dual-lit-channel-letters-pro\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LED modules)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"4,000 nits (front) + 2,000 nits (halo)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the main benefits of Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro compared to single-lit channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro feature both front-lit and halo backlighting, creating greater depth, visibility, and visual impact. This dual illumination offers vibrant colors and dynamic effects that single-lit signs cannot achieve.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the size options available for these channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Letter sizes range from 18 inches up to 96 inches, allowing for customization suitable for different branding needs and signage scales.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the lighting controlled on Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The lighting can be controlled via DMX or WiFi, enabling flexible operation and easy programming of effects like chase, fade, or static modes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness level of the front and halo lighting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The front illumination delivers 4,000 nits, while the halo backlighting offers 2,000 nits of brightness, ensuring excellent visibility in various ambient lighting conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does this product come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It includes a 5-year warranty, reflecting the premium quality and reliability of the materials and LED technology used.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complex for these dual-lit channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is straightforward for professional sign installers familiar with LED signage, and the system integrates well with conventional signage mounts. Support is also available from the supplier to ensure proper setup.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product enhance brand visibility in entertainment venues?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With its dual-light technology and independent RGB color control, it creates striking visual effects and vibrant appearances that attract customer attention and enhance ambient experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of effects can be programmed on these channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You can program chase, fade, and static effects, which allow dynamic or steady lighting appearance tailored to different marketing campaigns or brand storytelling.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/dual-lit-channel-letters-pro\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro</h1><p>Maximize visibility with Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro in Dubai. Get advanced LED signage solutions across UAE. Call now.</p><p><strong>Front and back illumination for maximum visual impact.</strong></p><p>The ultimate channel letter solution combining front-lit face illumination with halo backlighting. Dual LED arrays create depth and dimension that single-lit signs cannot match. Independent color control allows different day/night appearances or dynamic color shows. Premium choice for flagship locations demanding maximum brand presence.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the main benefits of Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro compared to single-lit channel letters?</h3><p>Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro feature both front-lit and halo backlighting, creating greater depth, visibility, and visual impact. This dual illumination offers vibrant colors and dynamic effects that single-lit signs cannot achieve.</p><h3>What are the size options available for these channel letters?</h3><p>Letter sizes range from 18 inches up to 96 inches, allowing for customization suitable for different branding needs and signage scales.</p><h3>How is the lighting controlled on Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro?</h3><p>The lighting can be controlled via DMX or WiFi, enabling flexible operation and easy programming of effects like chase, fade, or static modes.</p><h3>What is the brightness level of the front and halo lighting?</h3><p>The front illumination delivers 4,000 nits, while the halo backlighting offers 2,000 nits of brightness, ensuring excellent visibility in various ambient lighting conditions.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"dual-lit-channel-letters-pro\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/dual-lit-channel-letters-pro\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\