"Brightness\", \"value\": \"4,000 nits (front) + 2,000 nits (halo)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta5f,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the main benefits of Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro compared to single-lit channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro feature both front-lit and halo backlighting, creating greater depth, visibility, and visual impact. This dual illumination offers vibrant colors and dynamic effects that single-lit signs cannot achieve.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the size options available for these channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Letter sizes range from 18 inches up to 96 inches, allowing for customization suitable for different branding needs and signage scales.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the lighting controlled on Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The lighting can be controlled via DMX or WiFi, enabling flexible operation and easy programming of effects like chase, fade, or static modes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness level of the front and halo lighting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The front illumination delivers 4,000 nits, while the halo backlighting offers 2,000 nits of brightness, ensuring excellent visibility in various ambient lighting conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does this product come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It includes a 5-year warranty, reflecting the premium quality and reliability of the materials and LED technology used.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complex for these dual-lit channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is straightforward for professional sign installers familiar with LED signage, and the system integrates well with conventional signage mounts. Support is also available from the supplier to ensure proper setup.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product enhance brand visibility in entertainment venues?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With its dual-light technology and independent RGB color control, it creates striking visual effects and vibrant appearances that attract customer attention and enhance ambient experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of effects can be programmed on these channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You can program chase, fade, and static effects, which allow dynamic or steady lighting appearance tailored to different marketing campaigns or brand storytelling.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dual-Lit Channel Letters Pro\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/dual-lit-channel-letters-pro\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\